  "description": "../description.md",
  "install_text": "**Senstick Ambient SAM20**\n\nA discreet LoRaWAN ambient sensor for indoor monitoring of temperature, relative humidity, and air pressure.\n\n**Key features:**\n\n- LoRaWAN end-to-end encryption and data integrity protection\n- Monitors temperature, relative humidity, and air pressure\n- Built in tampering detection\n- Long battery life\n- Designed for indoor use\n- Diverse mounting options (screws, backplate, tape, nail)\n- Internal data logging (prevents data loss on weak connections)\n- Easily replaceable AA battery\n- Can be configured remotely or locally with Senzemo app\n\nDASHBOARD: https://admin.legacy.tago.io/template/6a9fd2358592a5000b252703",
